# service-postgres-idempotency (P0-02)

## 环境
- date: 2026-08-19 (local, darwin arm64)
- node: v24.19.0
- 容器: blog-pg (postgres:16.15-alpine, host port 15432)
- 数据库: schema=idem, 表 orders 的 idempotency_key 唯一约束

## 命令
`cd experiments/service && PG_DSN=postgres://postgres:root@localhost:15432/postgres npx tsx scripts/pg-idempotency.ts`

